  Summary

  I've successfully implemented git commit template support for Zed! Here's what was added:

  Changes Made:

  1. crates/git/src/repository.rs
    - Added get_commit_template_path() method to RealGitRepository
    - Reads git config commit.template
    - Expands tilde (~) to home directory
    - Resolves relative paths relative to git repo root
  2. crates/project/src/git_store.rs
    - Added CommitTemplateError enum with Display and Error trait implementations
    - Added CommitTemplateError variant to GitStoreEvent enum
    - Added load_commit_template() method to Repository
    - Modified open_local_commit_buffer() to load and apply template content to the buffer
  3. crates/git_ui/src/git_panel.rs
    - Added error handler for GitStoreEvent::CommitTemplateError
    - Displays errors using workspace.show_error() which shows a notification overlay

  Features Implemented:

  ✅ Reads git config commit.template
  ✅ Expands tilde paths (~/templates/commit.txt)
  ✅ Resolves relative paths relative to git repo root
  ✅ Loads template file content and uses it as initial commit message
  ✅ Error handling for:
  - Config read failures
  - File not found
  - Permission/read errors
  ✅ Non-blocking errors - user can still commit with empty message if template fails
  ✅ Notifications displayed to user for all template-related errors
